abstract: >-
  Self-contained re-evaluation of a quantitative trading system for the Indonesia Stock Exchange: purge and embargo, fold-local scaling, average-uniqueness sample weights, buy-and-hold and momentum baselines under identical costs, and per-ticker robustness tests.
